+6. **`dask.py`** - Line 1
+7. **`gui.py`** - Line 1
+8. **`keras.py`** - Line 1
+9. **`notebook.py`** - Line 1
+10. **`rich.py`** - Line 1
+11. **`std.py`** - Line 1
+
+This change adds a module-level constant named `BUILD_TAG` set to the string `'profiling'` to each of these files, allowing for easy identification of the build context within the codebase.
